== Notes ==

* In order to harm undead, the undead must be not [[PvP setting#Reactions|friendly]] and the caster must succeed with a ranged [[touch attack]]. If the attack succeeds, this spell inflicts [[positive energy damage]].
* This spell's description lists its area of effect as "large" when it is in fact "medium". It is possible that this is a bug in the implementation; compare with ''[[healing circle]]''.

